«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  GeomAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "GeomAll: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → pv Xv « pv 0 + Xv 0 + → p X « 'IFTE(X<1;0;1-((1-p)^IP(X)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<1;0;((1-p)^(IP(X)-1))*p)' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag '1/p' →Num "μ" →Tag '√(1-p)/p' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE pv Xv 2 →List Drop » »
»
